<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South American</p>
<p>Supercup first round, first leg soccer matches played on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>In Asuncion: Olimpia (Paraguay) 2 Sao Paulo (Brazil) 1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Olimpia - Fernando Silvera (41st minute), Felix Torres</p>
<p>(73rd)</p>
<p>Sao Paulo - Valdir (76th)</p>
<p>In La Plata, Argentina: Estudiantes (Argentina) 2 Colo Colo</p>
<p>(Chile) 4 (2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Estudiantes - Furgia (40th), Palermo (44th)</p>
<p>Colo Colo - Jose Luis Sierra (7th), Zapata (own goal, 50th),</p>
<p>Vergara (64th), Tapia (76th)</p>
</text>
